---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Disclaimer" description="Important information about StripUnion editorial content, third-party platforms and affiliate links.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="shell narrow"><span class="kicker">Disclaimer</span><h1>StripUnion publishes independent informational content.</h1><p class="lead">Third-party platforms control their own content, pricing, billing, availability, policies and legal compliance.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section shell narrow article-body">
    <h2>Information can change</h2><p>Platform features and terms can change after a StripUnion page is published or updated. Confirm material details directly with the provider before paying or creating an account.</p>
    <h2>Third-party responsibility</h2><p>StripUnion does not operate the third-party services it reviews and is not responsible for their content, billing, privacy practices, availability or user conduct.</p>
    <h2>Affiliate compensation</h2><p>Some clearly identified outbound links can generate compensation for StripUnion when a qualifying referral occurs.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
